        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "We are both very much pleased with our apartment..Being one of the first couples to sign up we were really looking forward to the move as only saw the plans on the brochure and on screen in sales office in the early stages of the building of Cara.\nThe staff from our sales rep Cynthia to management are\nProfessional and very helpful. Valet is also working very well\nWith great security in the building, plus reaching maintenance with a problem is solved immediately .\nHowever\nWe are now heading into August and the landscaping is not\nDone it seems to be taking forever…\nIf you want to attract clients work on the entrance\nLooking forward to the future and all that will be coming.\nLorraine and Norm",
        "time": 1753444920,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jacqulyn Hasting",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108133613414775301558/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
